(APHASIA COMPANION APP CONCEPT) Tj
T*
T*
(VISION) Tj
T*
(Create a conversational companion that helps people with aphasia express themselves confidently during daily interactions. The app listens, adapts to the user, and offers multimodal prompts—text, images, and speech—to keep conversations flowing naturally.) Tj
T*
T*
(CORE PRINCIPLES) Tj
T*
(1. **User-first communication** – Reduce frustration by prioritizing simplicity and speed) Tj
T*
(   over feature count.) Tj
T*
(2. **Adaptive assistance** – Personalize vocabulary, prompts, and interface layouts based) Tj
T*
(   on each person’s speech patterns and goals.) Tj
T*
(3. **Inclusive design** – Provide a calm visual style, large tap targets, optional) Tj
T*
(   contrast modes, and cross-device sync.) Tj
T*
(4. **Privacy-by-default** – Keep user utterances encrypted, with clear consent before any) Tj
T*
(   cloud processing.) Tj
T*
T*
(KEY USER SCENARIOS) Tj
T*
(• **Spontaneous chat**: The user taps a phrase starter, speaks, or types, and the app) Tj
T*
(  suggests likely follow-up words or sentences.) Tj
T*
(• **Errand support**: Before a store visit, the companion builds a quick “script” with key) Tj
T*
(  vocabulary, reference images, and barcodes.) Tj
T*
(• **Care partner collaboration**: Caregivers contribute custom phrases or review progress) Tj
T*
(  through shared notes.) Tj
T*
(• **Therapy bridge**: Speech-language pathologists assign tailored practice sets and) Tj
T*
(  review analytics between sessions.) Tj
T*
T*
(FEATURE OUTLINE) Tj
T*
(1. CONVERSATIONAL CANVAS) Tj
T*
(• Live speech capture with on-device recognition tuned for aphasic speech patterns.) Tj
T*
(• Word and phrase recommendations ranked by context, frequency, and user feedback.) Tj
T*
(• Quick visual cards \(emoji, photos, icons\) to complement verbal output.) Tj
T*
T*
(2. SMART VOCABULARY COACH) Tj
T*
(• Progressive word banks grouped by theme and difficulty.) Tj
T*
(• Spaced-repetition prompts blending speaking, reading, and choosing tasks.) Tj
T*
(• Feedback loop that celebrates attempts rather than only correct answers.) Tj
T*
T*
(3. CARE CIRCLE PORTAL) Tj
T*
(• Shared accounts with adjustable permissions for family, friends, and clinicians.) Tj
T*
(• Messaging layer for gentle reminders or encouragement.) Tj
T*
(• Secure export of progress summaries for therapy documentation.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
