(4. INTEGRATIONS) Tj
T*
(• **AI assistance**: Fine-tuned language model that understands the user’s unique) Tj
T*
(  phrasing, suggesting clarifications or follow-up sentences.) Tj
T*
(• **Voice recognition**: Hybrid pipeline combining on-device models for privacy and) Tj
T*
(  optional cloud enhancement for noisy environments.) Tj
T*
(• **Wearables**: Quick prompts via smartwatch complications and haptic cues for pacing.) Tj
T*
T*
(DATA & AI APPROACH) Tj
T*
(• Collect opt-in audio samples to adapt pronunciation models while giving users full) Tj
T*
(  control to delete data at any time.) Tj
T*
(• Train a small personalization layer \(e.g., LoRA adapters\) on-device or in a private) Tj
T*
(  workspace to keep the base model respectful and responsive.) Tj
T*
(• Incorporate explainability—show why the app recommended a phrase and allow one-tap) Tj
T*
(  feedback to improve future suggestions.) Tj
T*
T*
(ROADMAP SKETCH) Tj
T*
(1. **Discovery**: Interviews with people with aphasia, caregivers, and speech-language) Tj
T*
(   pathologists; create empathy maps.) Tj
T*
(2. **Prototype**: Figma flows and a React Native proof-of-concept focusing on the) Tj
T*
(   conversational canvas.) Tj
T*
(3. **Pilot**: Limited release with remote logging and weekly check-ins to observe real-) Tj
T*
(   world usage.) Tj
T*
(4. **Scale**: Harden infrastructure, pursue clinical validations, and add multilingual) Tj
T*
(   support.) Tj
T*
T*
(SUCCESS METRICS) Tj
T*
(• Reduced average time-to-utterance during conversations.) Tj
T*
(• Increased self-reported confidence scores post-interaction.) Tj
T*
(• Daily active usage across key features \(canvas, coach, care portal\).) Tj
T*
(• Positive clinician feedback on therapy alignment.) Tj
T*
T*
(ETHICAL & ACCESSIBILITY GUARDRAILS) Tj
T*
(• Transparent user agreements with plain-language summaries.) Tj
T*
(• Compatibility with screen readers and alternative input methods.) Tj
T*
(• Emergency assist mode that can call preset contacts or display medical info instantly.) Tj
T*
T*
(NEXT STEPS) Tj
T*
(• Draft research recruitment materials with aphasia advocacy groups.) Tj
T*
